yDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p82" target="p106"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p113" value="⑩" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#7030a0;fontColor=#5b2382;strokeWidth=1.5;exitX=1;exitY=0.36;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p82" target="p107"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p114" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#7030a0;fontColor=#5b2382;strokeWidth=1.5;exitX=1;exitY=0.47;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p82" target="p108"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p115" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#7030a0;fontColor=#5b2382;strokeWidth=1.5;exitX=1;exitY=0.73;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p82" target="p110"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p116" value="&lt;b&gt;Prometheus&lt;/b&gt; (LOCAL) — scrape 5s hub-api:4000/metrics · hub-worker:9101/metrics" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="600" width="220" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p117" value="&lt;b&gt;Grafana&lt;/b&gt; — dashboard “Webhook Hub”" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="690" width="220" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p118" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#7030a0;fontColor=#5b2382;strokeWidth=1.5;exitX=0.5;exitY=0;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=1;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p117" target="p116"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p119" value="scrape" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#7030a0;fontColor=#5b2382;strokeWidth=1.5;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.93;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p116" target="p71"><mxGeometry x="-0.5" relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="520" y="635"/><mxPoint x="520" y="592"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p120" value="&lt;b style='font-size:13px'&gt;LOCAL — docker-compose (đo đạc &amp;amp; chaos — MỌI số liệu báo cáo lấy ở đây)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;postgres :5433 · redis :6379 · rabbitmq :5672 / :15672 + &lt;b&gt;rabbitmq-init&lt;/b&gt; (đặt policy hub-dlq-bounded) · prometheus :9090 · grafana :3001&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;hub-api&lt;/b&gt; :4000 · &lt;b&gt;hub-worker&lt;/b&gt; (:9101 chỉ mạng nội bộ) — HAI service, scale được: --scale hub-worker=5&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;edge&lt;/b&gt; (nginx) :8080 · &lt;b&gt;shop&lt;/b&gt; :4001 · &lt;b&gt;web&lt;/b&gt; :3000&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;k6 bắn &lt;b&gt;localhost:4000&lt;/b&gt; (không qua tunnel — không thì đo ra độ trễ Cloudflare) · docker kill worker · tắt Redis / RabbitMQ&lt;br&gt;cloudflared &lt;b&gt;named tunnel&lt;/b&gt; để provider thật gọi vào khi dev (URL không đổi khi restart)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Redis tắt → hệ thống CHẬM đi (mọi chống trùng rơi về Postgres), KHÔNG SAI (BB-2)&lt;br&gt;Kill worker giữa chừng → message chưa ack quay lại queue; lease + processed_messages chặn gửi đôi (at-least-once + idempotent)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=6;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="1010" width="820" height="230" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p121" value="&lt;b style='font-size:13px'&gt;DEPLOYED — chứng minh online thật (KHÔNG đo p95 ở đây) · tất cả region Singapore&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Render&lt;/b&gt;: MỘT Web Service &lt;b&gt;hub-all&lt;/b&gt; (phương án D, ADR-129) — supervisor docker/hub-all.js (PID 1) sinh hub-api (nghe $PORT, hoặc 127.0.0.1:4000 sau edge) + hub-worker (WORKER_METRICS_PORT=0) [+ nginx edge khi EDGE_NGINX=1]. Vẫn hai tiến trình Node (BB-4), mỗi con 1 AMQP connection + pool Prisma riêng (connection_limit 5 + 5). Render &lt;b&gt;shop&lt;/b&gt; riêng (free, ngủ khi không dùng)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Vercel&lt;/b&gt;: web (Next.js) · &lt;b&gt;Neon&lt;/b&gt;: Postgres — DATABASE_URL (pooled) + DIRECT_URL (migrate), role hub_app / shop_user, autosuspend&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Upstash&lt;/b&gt;: Redis rediss:// — ngân sách ≤ 4 lệnh cố định / sự kiện + ≤ 2 / delivery (redis-budget.spec.ts)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;CloudAMQP&lt;/b&gt; Little Lemur: 1 connection / tiến trình; policy DLQ đặt tay qua management API&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;GitHub Actions&lt;/b&gt; cron 5' → shop /api/internal/reconcile (đối soát PayOS thuộc Shop) · &lt;b&gt;UptimeRobot&lt;/b&gt; ping /health 5'&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;HUB_INGEST_PUBLIC_URL&lt;/b&gt; (URL provider gọi, ADR-211) tách khỏi HUB_PUBLIC_URL · lưới hứng TẮT (CATCHNET_FORWARD_SECRET trống, Worker LH2 chưa có)&lt;br&gt;SIGTERM → drain → SHUTDOWN_TIMEOUT_MS = 25000 (Render SIGKILL ~30s); hub-api chỉ ghi nốt bộ đếm (≤ 5s, flushThenExit) rồi thoát, không drain: request dở bị cắt TRƯỚC 2xx → provider gửi lại (BB-2/BB-3 bảo đảm không mất, không đôi)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=6;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="860" y="1010" width="800" height="230" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram id="pg2" name="2. Ingest /hooks — thứ tự §3.1"><mxGraphModel dx="1600" dy="1000" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1960" pageHeight="1920" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="p2" value='&lt;b style="font-size:20px"&gt;2 · Luồng ingest GET|POST /hooks/:provider/:sourceKey — thứ tự thực thi trong code (main.ts › penalty-gate.ts › ingest.controller.ts › ingest.service.ts › ingestCore)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12px;color:#444"&gt;Chỉ verify → lưu → trả lời; không gọi dịch vụ ngoài. Mọi nhánh dừng ngay tại bước đó và mang x-hub-outcome (ADR-221). Bước ⓪′/②b của lưới hứng chỉ thay IP và “bây giờ” — không đổi thứ tự (ADR-217, trang 10).&lt;/span&gt;' style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="10" width="1920" height="56" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p3" value="Chú giải" style="rounded=1;arcSize=2;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;dashed=1;fillColor=none;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=8;fontStyle=1;fontSize=12;strokeColor=#555555;fontColor=#333333;fillColor=#ffffff;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1690" y="80" width="250" height="508" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p4" value="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#2f5597;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1700" y="110" width="46" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p5" value="Tiến trình (swimlane)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1752" y="107" width="180" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxC