&gt;&lt;b&gt;events&lt;/b&gt; (seq, &lt;b&gt;poll_seq&lt;/b&gt; cấp lúc poll, probe, verified)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;destinations&lt;/b&gt; (verification PENDING/VERIFIED/FAILED, signing_secret_encrypted) · &lt;b&gt;subscriptions&lt;/b&gt; (event_types[], source_ids[], accept_unverified)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;sources&lt;/b&gt; · &lt;b&gt;source_secrets&lt;/b&gt; · &lt;b&gt;source_connections&lt;/b&gt; (credentials_encrypted)&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;đọc/ghi: findApiKeyByHash · TX raw_events+outbox · advisory lock + UPDATE poll_seq + SELECT · TX endpoint+subscription&lt;/i&gt;" style="shape=cylinder3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;boundedLbl=1;size=12;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#2d7a2d;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1160" y="300" width="500" height="250" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p78" value="SQL" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#2d7a2d;fontColor=#1e5a1e;strokeWidth=1.5;exitX=1;exitY=0.42;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.2;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p60" target="p77"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p79" value="&lt;b&gt;Người dùng console&lt;/b&gt; — web Next.js (Vercel) proxy /api/* · /auth/* (cookie first-party)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="760" width="250" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p80" value="&lt;b&gt;PayOS API&lt;/b&gt; confirm-webhook · &lt;b&gt;Stripe API&lt;/b&gt; webhook_endpoints (connector, base URL cứng ở production)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="880" width="250" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p81" value="hub-api — Console /api/v1/* (cookie phiên)" style="swimlane;startSize=28;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;arcSize=2;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#2f5597;fontColor=#1f3864;fontStyle=1;fontSize=13;swimlaneFillColor=#f4f8fd;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="740" width="830" height="490" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p82" value="&lt;b&gt;SessionGuard&lt;/b&gt; — JWT 15' trong cookie __Host-hub_at; session còn sống bằng MỘT truy vấn PK (thu hồi có hiệu lực ngay, không Redis) · CSRF double-submit" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#2f5597;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="p81"><mxGeometry x="20" y="40" width="250" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p83" value="&lt;b&gt;ProjectScopeGuard&lt;/b&gt; — ?projectId= · resolveProjectScope: tồn tại + là thành viên (project_members.role) hoặc operator — HTTP và vé socket dùng chung" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#2f5597;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="p81"><mxGeometry x="290" y="40" width="250" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p84" value="&lt;b&gt;@RequireScope&lt;/b&gt; (ROLE_SCOPES owner / developer / viewer) → controller → prisma.forTenant(projectId)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#2f5597;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="p81"><mxGeometry x="560" y="40" width="250" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p85" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#333333;fontColor=#000000;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p82" target="p83"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p86" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#333333;fontColor=#000000;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p83" target="p84"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p87" value="/api/v1/*" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#7030a0;fontColor=#5b2382;strokeWidth=1.5;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p79" target="p82"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="295" y="810"/><mxPoint x="295" y="840"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p88" value="&lt;b&gt;POST /api/v1/sources/connect&lt;/b&gt; — “Kết nối PayOS / Stripe” (ADR-138/142/146) · lõi chỉ đọc adapter.connector?.spec, không if (provider === …)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#2f5597;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="p81"><mxGeometry x="20" y="190" width="790" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p89" value="&lt;b&gt;① TX&lt;/b&gt;: Source + SourceSecret (checksumKey) + source_connections PENDING + audit → &lt;b&gt;COMMIT&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#2f5597;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="p81"><mxGeometry x="20" y="260" width="250" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p90" value="&lt;b&gt;② NGOÀI TX&lt;/b&gt;: connector.connect(ingestUrl = publicIngestBase()/hooks/&amp;lt;provider&amp;gt;/&amp;lt;sourceKey&amp;gt;) — HUB_INGEST_PUBLIC_URL, thiếu → HUB_PUBLIC_URL (ADR-211); nội bộ → 422 public_url_required" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#2f5597;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="p81"><mxGeometry x="290" y="260" width="250" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p91" value="&lt;b&gt;③ TX&lt;/b&gt;: CONNECTED + display (+ secret do provider sinh) | FAILED + last_error / last_fix (source giữ lại, “Thử lại”)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#2f5597;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="p81"><mxGeometry x="560" y="260" width="250" height="110" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p92" value="Thứ tự cố định = lời giải cạm bẫy 4: provider bắn request KIỂM TRA vào /hooks NGAY lúc ② → source phải đã COMMIT, verify được, trả 200. Request kiểm tra PayOS (orderCode 123 + description VQRIO123 + reference TF230204212323) → payos.webhook_test, probe:true → lưu, KHÔNG định tuyến. Credentials provider lưu mã hoá (source_connections.credentials_encrypted, AES-256-GCM MASTER_KEY, RLS FORCE), không route nào trả lại. PK5 khoá 1: PUT /api/v1/projects/:id/unverified-sources (owner) bật projects.allow_unverified_sources. PK9: GET /api/v1/catalog (read:project) → identify() chạy ở trình duyệt." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=6;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="p81"><mxGeometry x="20" y="390" width="790" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p93" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#333333;fontColor=#000000;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.9;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p84" target="p88"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p94" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#333333;fontColor=#000000;exitX=0.16;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;