ze=2;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;dashed=1;fillColor=none;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=8;fontStyle=1;fontSize=12;strokeColor=#c00000;fontColor=#c00000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1160" y="580" width="500" height="690" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p100" value="&lt;b&gt;Lớp 1 — guard&lt;/b&gt;: ApiKeyGuard (key → tenantId) · SessionGuard + ProjectScopeGuard (membership / operator) · ingest: source.tenant_id" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#2f5597;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1175" y="615" width="470" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p101" value="&lt;b&gt;Lớp 2 — TenantScopedRepository&lt;/b&gt; (prisma.forTenant(t) / tenantTx(t)): mọi truy vấn thêm tenant_id; mỗi transaction SELECT set_config('app.project_id', t, true); khoá ngoại ghép (subscription → destination, tenant_id)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#2f5597;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1175" y="705" width="470" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p102" value="&lt;b&gt;Lớp 3 — Postgres RLS FORCE&lt;/b&gt;: runtime = role &lt;b&gt;hub_app&lt;/b&gt; NOSUPERUSER NOBYPASSRLS (sai → app thoát); policy theo current_setting('app.project_id')&lt;br&gt;bảng: sources · events · destinations · subscriptions · deliveries · audit_logs · source_secrets · raw_events · delivery_attempts · source_connections · alerts · alert_emails · project_usage · storage_policies · storage_clean_jobs · source_traffic_minutely · ingest_duplicates" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#2d7a2d;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1175" y="815" width="470" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p103" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#333333;fontColor=#000000;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p100" target="p101"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p104" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#2d7a2d;fontColor=#1e5a1e;strokeWidth=1.5;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p101" target="p102"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p105" value="&lt;b&gt;Lối xuyên project DUY NHẤT, có tên&lt;/b&gt;: PrismaService.systemTx('&amp;lt;lý do&amp;gt;') — sweeper · cleanup · storage tick · alert email outbox · operator (relay đọc outbox — bảng không RLS)&lt;br&gt;findSourceBySourceKeyForIngest (app.rls_system — tenant chưa biết) · findApiKeyByHash&lt;br&gt;Hạ tầng không RLS: &lt;b&gt;outbox&lt;/b&gt;, &lt;b&gt;processed_messages&lt;/b&gt; (payload chỉ là tham chiếu)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=6;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1175" y="965" width="470" height="130" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p106" value="BB-5: không query nào không scope — kể cả “chỉ để debug”. Test rls-db.spec.ts: project A không đọc được B dù biết UUID" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=20;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#c00000;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#c00000;fontStyle=1;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1175" y="1110" width="470" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p107" value="Lớp thứ tư — cô lập TÀI NGUYÊN (noisy neighbor): rate limit theo source + hộp phạt · trần SOURCE_LIMIT_PER_PROJECT=20 · hạn mức dung lượng (trang 8) · DELIVERY_TIMEOUT_MS + circuit" style="rounded=0;