source="p48" target="p49"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p51" value="HTTP ra / vào bên ngoài" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1752" y="525" width="180" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p52" value="" style="text;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1698" y="560" width="1" height="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p53" value="" style="text;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1746" y="560" width="1" height="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p54" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#cc0000;fontColor=#cc0000;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 3;endSize=5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p52" target="p53"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p55" value="nhánh lỗi" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1752" y="549" width="180" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p56" value="hub-api — đo ở cửa vào (0 DB, 0 Redis trên đường nóng)" style="swimlane;startSize=28;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;arcSize=2;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#2f5597;fontColor=#1f3864;fontStyle=1;fontSize=13;swimlaneFillColor=#f4f8fd;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="90" width="560" height="610" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p57" value="&lt;b&gt;ingest traced()&lt;/b&gt; → TrafficRecorder.record(tenant, source, minute, outcome, ip, bytes = rawBody.length) — cộng vào Map trong bộ nhớ (+0 DB, +0 Redis)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#f2f2f2;strokeColor=#7f7f7f;dashed=1;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="p56"><mxGeometry x="10" y="38" width="540" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p58" value="&lt;b&gt;flush mỗi TRAFFIC_FLUSH_MS (60s)&lt;/b&gt;: mỗi project MỘT câu upsert qua forTenant (RLS): count = count + excluded.count, bytes cộng dồn, top_ips gộp còn 5 → N instance cùng ghi vẫn cộng đúng · ghi lỗi → giữ ≤ 10 phút rồi bỏ phần cũ (hub_traffic_flush_dropped_total) · tắt máy: ghi nốt best-effort" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#2f5597;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="p56"><mxGeometry x="10" y="116" width="540" height="92" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p59" value="&lt;b&gt;DuplicateCounter&lt;/b&gt; — bản trùng không có dòng raw_events → đếm bộ nhớ, ghi mỗi ~5s (nhận định I-dup)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#f2f2f2;strokeColor=#7f7f7f;dashed=1;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="p56"><mxGeometry x="10" y="222" width="540" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p60" value="&lt;b&gt;②q của ingest&lt;/b&gt; (trang 2): nấc đọc từ project_usage.level (LEFT JOIN cùng câu nạp source) → isWriteBlocked(level, keepLonger, STORAGE_LOCK_ENABLED) → &lt;b&gt;507 project_storage_full&lt;/b&gt; TRƯỚC verify / rate limit. Chỉ khoá chiều GHI: giao event đã COMMIT, polling, dọn vẫn chạy" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#2f5597;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="p56"><mxGeometry x="10" y="286" width="540" height="76" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p61" value="&lt;b&gt;GET /api/v1/projects/:projectId/sources/:id/traffic&lt;/b&gt;?range=1h|24h|7d (scope traffic:read — owner / operator) → {buckets, topIps, insight I-traffic, blockedNow}" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#2f5597;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="p56"><mxGeometry x="10" y="376" width="540" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p62" value="&lt;b&gt;POST /api/v1/projects/:projectId/storage/clean&lt;/b&gt; · &lt;b&gt;/storage/suggestions/:suggestionId/apply&lt;/b&gt; · PUT storage/policies — action trim (“Dọn”) | delete (“Xoá hẳn”); cutoff phải ≤ now − TOTAL_RETRY_WINDOW_MS (parseCleanRequest) → INSERT storage_clean_jobs + audit_logs" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#2f5597;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="p56"><mxGeometry x="10" y="454" width="540" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p63" value="outcome ∈ ACCEPTED · DUPLICATE · REJECTED · RATE_LIMITED · BLOCKED · STORAGE_FULL. 404 sourceKey lạ KHÔNG vào bảng (không thuộc tenant nào) — chỉ metric hub_ingest_unknown_source_total. Số liệu quan sát: được phép thiếu, không được làm chậm ingest" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=6;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="p56"><mxGeometry x="10" y="538" width="540" height="62" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p64" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#333333;fontColor=#000000;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p57" target="p58"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p65" value="&lt;b&gt;PostgreSQL schema hub&lt;/b&gt; (RLS)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;source_traffic_minutely&lt;/b&gt; PK(tenant_id, source_id, minute, outcome) · count · bytes · top_ips&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;ingest_duplicates&lt;/b&gt; PK(tenant_id, source_id, bucket)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;project_usage&lt;/b&gt; (tenant_id PK) · used_bytes · calibrated_bytes · calibrated_at · freed_since_calibration · bloat_factor · level · signaled_level · suggestions&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;storage_policies&lt;/b&gt; PK(tenant_id, importance) · &lt;b&gt;storage_clean_jobs&lt;/b&gt; (lease)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;events&lt;/b&gt; · &lt;b&gt;raw_events&lt;/b&gt; (body_raw) — thứ chiếm chỗ" style="shape=cylinder3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;boundedLbl=1;size=12;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#2d7a2d;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="620" y="330" width="330" height="370" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p66" value="upsert theo lô" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#2d7a2d;fontColor=#1e5a1e;strokeWidth=1.5;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.1;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p58" target="p65"><mxGeometry x="-0.3" relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="600" y="252"/><mxPoint x="600" y="367"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p67" value="đọc level" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#2d7a2d;fontColor=#1e5a1e;strokeWidth=1.5;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.3;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p60" target="p65"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p68" value="INSERT job" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#2d7a2d;fontColor=#1e5a1e;strokeWidth=1.5;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.75;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p62" target="p65"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p69" value="hub-worker — StorageJob · StorageAlerts · StorageCleanRunner (QT2/QT4/QT6)" style="swimlane;startSize=28;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;arcSize=2;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#2f5597;fontColor=#1f3864;fontStyle=1;fontSize=13;swimlaneFillColor=#f4f8fd;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="990" y="90" width="680" height="610" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p70" value="&lt;b&gt;① level tick&lt;/b&gt; mỗi STORAGE_LEVEL_INTERVAL_MS (60s): SET storage:level:lock {instanceId} NX EX (90% chu kỳ) — Redis lỗi → bỏ lượt (đo chậm 1 nhịp không sai)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#2f5597;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="p69"><mxGeometry x="10" y="38" width="400" height="62" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p71" value="systemTx('storage: level tick') — MỘT truy vấn gộp xuyên project:&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;used = calibrated_bytes + bloat_factor × Σ bytes (traffic sau mốc) − freed_since_calibration&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#2f5597;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="p69"><mxGeometry x="10" y="114" width="400" height="76" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p72" value="levelFor(used, quota, prev) — có vùng đệm: OK · WARN_70 · WARN_85 · CRITICAL_95 · &lt;b&gt;LOCKED&lt;/b&gt; (≥ 100%) · &lt;b&gt;HARD_LOCKED&lt;/b&gt; (≥ 110%); rời ở 65 / 80 / 90 / 90 / 100%. Hạn mức PROJECT_STORAGE_QUOTA_MB (50)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#2f5597;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="p69"><mxGeometry x="10" y="204" width="400" height="76" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p73" value="đổi nấc → forTenant.updateStorageUsage() → &lt;b&gt;StorageAlerts&lt;/b&gt;: alert project.storage_* (audience owners+operator) + email theo nấc + webhook &lt;b&gt;hub.project.storage&lt;/b&gt; (emitHubEvent, vẫn phát khi LOCKED) · nấc LÊN → &lt;b&gt;hub.project.cleanup_suggested&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#2f5597;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="p69"><mxGeometry x="10" y="294" width="400" height="92" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p74" value="&lt;b&gt;② hiệu chỉnh&lt;/b&gt; mỗi 24h: SET storage:calibrate:lock NX EX → measureStorage từng project (lô 50, statement_timeout 55s) → calibrated_bytes, bloat_factor; gợi ý qua &lt;b&gt;CleanupAdvisor&lt;/b&gt; (hàng rào an toàn nằm NGOÀI advisor)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#2f5597;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="p69"><mxGeometry x="10" y="400" width="400" height="92" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p75" value="&lt;b&gt;③ StorageCleanRunner&lt;/b&gt;: storageClaimCleanJobAcrossTenants FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED + lease (0 Redis) → mỗi lô: trim = bỏ nội dung, giữ dòng gầy (chống trùng còn — BB-2) | delete = mất chống trùng → trừ used_bytes, hạ nấc NGAY · sàn retryWindowFloor kiểm lại ở worker" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#2f5597;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="p69"><mxGeometry x="10" y="506" width="400" height="94" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p76" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#333333;fontColor=#000000;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p70" target="p71"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p77" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#333333;fontColor=#000000;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p71" target="p72"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p78" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#333333;fontColor=#000000;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p72" target="p73"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p79" value="Σ bytes, project_usage" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#2d7a2d;fontColor=#1e5a1e;strokeWidth=1.5;exitX=0;exitY=0.6;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.12;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p71" target="p65"><mxGeometry x="0.3" relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="970" y="250"/><mxPoint x="970" y="374"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p80" value="lô dọn" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#2d7a2d;fontColor=#1e5a1e;strokeWidth=1.5;exitX=0;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.85;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p75" target="p65"><mxGeometry x="-0.3" relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="970" y="643"/><mxPoint x="970" y="645"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p81" value="&lt;b&gt;Redis — khoá job&lt;/b&gt; (SET key {instanceId} NX EX ~90% chu kỳ, KHÔNG nhả)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;storage:level:lock&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;storage:calibrate:lock&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;cleanup:lock&lt;/b&gt; (EX ≥ 300s)&lt;br&gt;Chỉ job định kỳ dùng Redis lock; relay / sweeper / evaluator dùng SKIP LOCKED / ON CONFLICT" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#a50021;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="p69"><mxGeometry x="430" y="38" width="240" height="160" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p82" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#a50021;fontColor=#a50021;strokeWidth=1.5;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.2;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p70" target="p81"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p83" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#a50021;fontColor=#a50021;strokeWidth=1.5;exitX=1;exitY=0.3;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.75;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p74" target="p81"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1410" y="518"/><mxPoint x="1410" y="248"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p84" value="&lt;b&gt;Cờ an toàn (E5)&lt;/b&gt;: STORAGE_LOCK_ENABLED = 0 và STORAGE_AUTO_CLEAN_ENABLED = 0 mặc định ở production (checklist bật: DEPLOYMENT §4.3). Tắt khoá → vẫn đo, vẫn đổi nấc, chỉ đếm hub_ingest_storage_would_reject_total. Chốt toàn cục DB_DISK_BUDGET_MB × 80% → cảnh báo operator hub.storage_near_full" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=6;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="p69"><mxGeometry x="430" y="220" width="240" height="166" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p85" value="BB-1: mức quan trọng là hàm thuần trên tín hiệu CHUNG (trạng thái giao, tuổi, cờ “Giữ lâu” user tự gắn) — hub không đoán nghiệp vụ. BB-2: “Dọn” giữ dòng gầy → UNIQUE chống trùng vẫn còn; audit_logs không bao giờ bị dọn." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=20;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#c00000;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#c00000;fontStyle=1;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="p69"><mxGeometry x="430" y="400" width="240" height="200" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p86" value="hub-worker — CleanupJob (cleanup.job.ts) — mỗi CLEANUP_INTERVAL_MS (1h), khoá Redis cleanup:lock" style="swimlane;startSize=28;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;arcSize=2;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#2f5597;fontColor=#1f3864;fontStyle=1;fontSize=13;swimlaneFillColor=#f4f8fd;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="740" width="1650" height="360" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p87" value="&lt;b&gt;① SET cleanup:lock {instanceId} NX EX max(300, 90% chu kỳ)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;không giành được → bỏ lượt (instance khác đang dọn); Redis lỗi → bỏ lượt" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#2f5597;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="p86"><mxGeometry x="10" y="40" width="300" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p88" value="&lt;b&gt;② systemTx('cleanup: dọn theo lô')&lt;/b&gt; — lô 5000, lặp tới hết:&lt;br&gt;· DELETE &lt;b&gt;outbox&lt;/b&gt; published_at &amp;lt; now − EVENT_RETENTION_DAYS (7)&lt;br&gt;· DELETE &lt;b&gt;processed_messages&lt;/b&gt; &amp;gt; 7 ngày&lt;br&gt;· DELETE &lt;b&gt;raw_events&lt;/b&gt; REJECTED hết hạn — trừ byte vào project_usage CÙNG câu (deleteExpiredRejectedBatchAccounted)&lt;br&gt;· DELETE &lt;b&gt;events&lt;/b&gt; hết hạn — trừ byte; BỎ QUA event còn delivery PENDING/DELIVERING/RETRYING (IN_FLIGHT_DELIVERY_STATUSES, ADR-199)&lt;br&gt;· &lt;b&gt;auth_sessions&lt;/b&gt; &amp;gt; 30 ngày · &lt;b&gt;email_tokens&lt;/b&gt; &amp;gt; 7 ngày (IdentityRepository)&lt;br&gt;· &lt;b&gt;ingest_duplicates&lt;/b&gt; &amp;gt; 30 ngày · &lt;b&gt;source_traffic_minutely&lt;/b&gt; &amp;gt; TRAFFIC_RETENTION_DAYS (7)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;KHÔNG xoá raw_events ACCEPTED (ADR-045) · audit_logs không bao giờ bị dọn" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#2f5597;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="p86"><mxGeometry x="330" y="40" width="560" height="300" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p89" value="&lt;b&gt;③ recomputeLevelsAfterRetention()&lt;/b&gt; — tính lại nấc NGAY cho project vừa được giải phóng (mở khoá sớm, không chờ tick 60s)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#2f5597;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="p86"><mxGeometry x="910" y="40" width="330" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p90" value="&lt;b&gt;④ dọn tự động theo storage_policies&lt;/b&gt; (STORAGE_AUTO_CLEAN_ENABLED) — CÙNG khoá cleanup:lock, ≤ AUTO_CLEAN_MAX_BATCHES (20) lô, theo policy user đặt (trigger always | above_85)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#2f5597;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="p86"><mxGeometry x="910" y="180" width="330" height="160" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p91" value="&lt;b&gt;Sàn TOTAL_RETRY_WINDOW_MS&lt;/b&gt; (libs/messaging/src/retry-window.ts — nguồn duy nhất)&lt;br&gt;= Σ TTL 5 tầng (9 370s) + 5 × 30s normalize + NORMALIZE_MAX_DEFER_MS (60') + 30s&lt;br&gt;+ 6 lần thử × (CIRCUIT_MAX_DEFER_MS 30' + 1 vòng hoãn 5' + ramp 60s+10s + giữ permit 60s)&lt;br&gt;= &lt;b&gt;26 530 000 ms ≈ 7h22m10s&lt;/b&gt; (BP2–BP5)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• assertRetentionSafe: EVENT_RETENTION_DAYS × 1 ngày phải &amp;gt; sàn — sai → ném lỗi lúc khởi động (processed_messages/outbox bị xoá trước khi retry xong = mất chốt idempotency)&lt;br&gt;• lệnh dọn / policy: cutoff ≤ now − sàn (hub-api parseCleanRequest + worker retryWindowFloor)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;lệnh dọn olderThan dưới ~7h23m → 400&lt;/i&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=6;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="p86"><mxGeometry x="1260" y="40" width="380" height="300" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p92" value="OK" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#a50021;fontColor=#a50021;strokeWidth=1.5;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.2;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p87" target="p88"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p93" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#333333;fontColor=#000000;exitX=1;exitY=0.2;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p88" target="p89"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p94" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#333333;fontColor=#000000;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p89" target="p90"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p95" value="&lt;b&gt;Redis&lt;/b&gt; SET cleanup:lock {instanceId} NX EX … — khoá DUY NHẤT của cleanup (relay không cần: SKIP LOCKED)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#a50021;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="p86"><mxGeometry x="10" y="190" width="300" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p96" value="SET NX" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#a50021;fontColor=#a50021;strokeWidth=1.5;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p87" target="p95"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p97" value="DELETE theo lô" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#2d7a2d;fontColor=#1e5a1e;strokeWidth=1.5;exitX=0;exitY=0.1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=1;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p88" target="p65"><mxGeometry x="0.5" relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="338" y="810"/><mxPoint x="338" y="722"/><mxPoint x="785" y="722"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p98" value="&lt;b&gt;hub.project.storage&lt;/b&gt; / &lt;b&gt;hub.project.cleanup_suggested&lt;/b&gt; đi ĐÚNG đường của mọi event (emitHubEvent → events + deliveries PENDING + outbox delivery.requested trong transaction của người gọi — trang 4): destination nào đăng ký kiểu này thì nhận, polling cũng thấy; source='hub', sourceId=null (subscription lọc sourceIds sẽ không nhận). Cảnh báo dung lượng → room project:&amp;lt;id&amp;gt;:owners (trang 7)." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=6;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="1130" width="1650" height="56" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p99" value="&lt;b&gt;Trần tạo source&lt;/b&gt;: SOURCE_LIMIT_PER_PROJECT = 20 (QT9) — khoá đếm trong transaction (pg_advisory_xact_lock 'source-create:' + tenant). Rate limit theo source (EG3) + hộp phạt (EG2) chặn TỐC ĐỘ; hạn mức dung lượng chặn THỂ TÍCH — hai trục khác nhau của noisy neighbor." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=6;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="1200" width="1650" height="44" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram id="pg9" name="9. Áp lực ngược (BP1–BP6)"><mxGraphModel dx="1600" dy="1000" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1960" pageHeight="1284" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="p2" value='&lt;b style="font-size:20px"&gt;9 · Áp lực ngược khi hạ tầng của CHÍNH hub lỗi (BP5, ADR-200) + mọi đường hoãn của một message (BP1–BP4, BP6)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:12px;color:#444"&gt;Bộ điều khiển cục bộ mỗi tiến trình hub-worker, 0 lệnh Redis. Tín hiệu CHỈ là lỗi hạ tầng hub (classifyInfraError = transient) — lỗi của ĐÍCH không bao giờ là tín hiệu (đích chết của tenant A không làm chậm tenant B).&lt;/span&gt;' style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="10" width="1920" height="56" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p3" value="Chú giải" style="rounded=1;arcSize=2;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;dashed=1;fillColor=none;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=8;fontStyle=1;fontSize=12;strokeColor=#555555;fontColor=#333333;fillColor=#ffffff;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1690" y="80" width="250" height="508" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p4" value="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#2f5597;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1700" y="110" width="46" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p5" value="Tiến trình (swimlane)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1752" y="107" width="180" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p6" value="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#2f5597;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1700" y="134" width="46" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p7" value="Bước xử lý trong tiến trình" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1752" y="131" width="180" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p8" value="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#f2f2f2;strokeColor=#7f7f7f;dashed=1;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1700" y="158" width="46" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p9" value="Trạng thái trong bộ nhớ tiến trình" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1752" y="155" width="180" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p10" value="" style="shape=cylinder3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;boundedLbl=1;size=4;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#2d7a2d;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1700" y="182" width="46" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p11" value="PostgreSQL (bảng)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1752" y="179" width="180" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p12" value="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#a50021;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1700" y="206" width="46" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p13" value="Redis (khoá · lệnh)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1752" y="203" width="180" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p14" value="" style="shape=hexagon;perimeter=hexagonPerimeter2;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=0.1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1700" y="230" width="46" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p15" value="RabbitMQ exchange" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1752" y="227" width="180" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p16" value="" style="shape=process;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=0.06;fillColor=#fff2e6;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1700" y="254" width="46" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p17" value="RabbitMQ queue" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1752" y="251" width="180" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p18" value="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1700" y="278" width="46" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p19" value="Bên ngoài (provider · đích · người)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1752" y="275" width="180" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p20" value="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=20;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#c00000;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#c00000;fontStyle=1;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1700" y="302" width="46" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p21" value="Bất biến BB-x được bảo vệ ở đây" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1752" y="299" width="180" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p22" value="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=30;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#2d7a2d;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#2d7a2d;fontStyle=1;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1700" y="326" width="46" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p23" value="Trả 2xx" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=middle;"